# Expressions
@scenario tutorial_lesson_03
@include /definitions/characters.vns
@label start
[mode dialogue standard]
[set ui.dialogueUi project]
[bg room]
[char pip global on]
[set ui.dialogueFadeMs 160]
[stage clear]
[show pip guide point]
pip: Watch how changing the expression affects the same line.
[show pip guide surprised]
pip: Oh!
[show pip guide curious]
pip: Replace surprised with curious in the second show command. Run the same line again.
> Review question -> check
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label check
pip: How do you change my reaction in place?
> Show pip in the same slot with another expression. -> correct
> Declare a new background named curious. -> retry
> Back to topics -> return_hub
@label retry
[show pip guide curious]
pip: The slot stays occupied while its expression changes. Give it another try.
[jump check]
@label correct
[show pip guide cheer]
pip: The slot stays occupied while its expression changes.
> Back to topics -> return_hub
> Replay example -> start
@label return_hub
[if !tutorial_done_03]
[flag tutorial_done_03]
[inc tutorial_count]
[endif]
[stage clear]
[goto TutorialHub:topics_page_2]
